{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28035","headline":"送刘思复南河从军 · 朱庆余","name":"送刘思复南河从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七千里别宁无恨，且贵从军乐事多。\n不驻节旄先候发，偶逢山寺亦难过。\n蛮人独放畲田火，海兽羣游落日波。\n远作受恩身不易，莫抛书劒近笙歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}